{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0274_2001_037nao", "source_sha256": "ea2cde1a74c9c1cca031651bc2f19136cfcd4c435d8f41ac0a872b0c68802486", "ja": "わあっ！？　えっ、{$P$}さん！\nなんで急に驚かすんですか！？", "zh": "哇啊！？　呃，{$P$}先生！\n干嘛突然吓人啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0274_2002_p", "source_sha256": "5cf4216214382dc2949505fa55f991ce9a5de0a26888087973d6806babd9ee4f", "ja": "いや、驚かしたわけじゃなくて……。\n一度声掛けても、気づいて貰えなかったんだよ。", "zh": "不是，我不是故意吓你的……  \n我叫过你一次，可你没注意到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0274_2003_037nao", "source_sha256": "10461722fa62c0ef5747202a1b32dc25f6e62b571dfbe748fd80b2243a366785", "ja": "えっ、ほんまですか！？　ごめんなさい！\nううっ、ちょっと集中しすぎてたわ……。", "zh": "诶，真的吗！？对不起！\n呜呜，刚才有点太专注了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0274_2004_p", "source_sha256": "494e3ede0b0551bc2c09f772fa7321cd4e16979be484f7b14b9728dfc9a18b1b", "ja": "そんなに夢中になるくらい、\nその衣装を気に入ってくれたってことかな？", "zh": "你是喜欢那套服装喜欢到如此着迷了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0274_2005_037nao", "source_sha256": "c750a5e9cf00345809372939fe9977e0b8fe33f670801188a1b5f60b4a6c5cc0", "ja": "はい！　自分で言うのもなんですけど、\nメッチャ似合ってると思いません！？", "zh": "是的！虽然这么说有点自恋，但您不觉得这套衣服特别适合我吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0274_2006_037nao", "source_sha256": "a6c24db62896d83083feee432481f0e6fc483018e3dec76c37ece9ec02597189", "ja": "着てるだけで、なんやテンションが上がってきて……\nだんだん気分が落ち着かんように……ハッ！", "zh": "光是穿着它，情绪就不知不觉高涨起来了……\n渐渐变得有些静不下心来……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0274_2007_037nao", "source_sha256": "33a9d9c73828bb7a2063a94a151a367899c586945dea8e9d50ba623bb218d473", "ja": "すみません、{$P$}さん……。\nさっきから私ひとりで盛り上がってますね。", "zh": "对不起，{$P$}先生……  \n从刚才开始就只有我一个人在兴奋呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0274_2008_p", "source_sha256": "08336ee0efc08f780c6a8e1ad5c548c496c330a67c751193a5929cd2eb3a8236", "ja": "ははっ、全然いいよ。\nそんなに喜んでもらえて、こっちも嬉しいよ。", "zh": "哈哈，完全没关系。\n你能这么开心，我也很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0274_2009_037nao", "source_sha256": "dae04f49de664aecc267c857ece615c25feb7e2e4c154c71ec9dbb9797e3b842", "ja": "そうですか？　でも……私がやらなアカンのって、\nお客さんを楽しませることやないですか。", "zh": "是吗？可是……我该做的，不就是让客人开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0274_2010_037nao", "source_sha256": "edfd069b2b1fdd704fafeb2ff0ac439c1eb297539e2a6d970ec34dac2276fcd2", "ja": "このままやと、お客さんそっちのけで\n楽しんでまいそうな気して……。", "zh": "照这样下去，我感觉会把客人丢在一边，自己玩得开心起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0274_2011_p", "source_sha256": "403c5e573c264075d72146b1c75837e94f8d40547be5e849fd685c03ef2e5c92", "ja": "ん？　それでいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "嗯？那样不就挺好的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0274_2012_037nao", "source_sha256": "d1f36b7d5c6fe550cdc33f0492bb8f1726a2a554909a56ceb692c494a12642be", "ja": "へっ？", "zh": "欸？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0274_2013_p", "source_sha256": "443f5dfdfb3af80135d8669bd1ae6bea500409a1b157fb8d36a63513fea36b2b", "ja": "ああ、もちろん、お客さんのことは考えて欲しいけど。\nでも奈緒が楽しむのはいいことだと思うんだ。", "zh": "啊，当然，我也希望你能考虑到观众。\n不过，我觉得奈绪自己享受其中也是件好事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0274_2014_p", "source_sha256": "0d4faefe104e1f4404959652e7ba5bd49f0c8657d21117b0acd45cebe47226ed", "ja": "奈緒が楽しむからこそ、お客さんも楽しませられると\n思うよ。だから、全力で楽しんでいこう！", "zh": "正因为奈绪乐在其中，才能让观众们也乐在其中。\n所以，全力去享受吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0274_2015_037nao", "source_sha256": "ec1bb3b85b0393581a2ce566047cd3c95da911ae92065b5f01c744c8057dc094", "ja": "そ、そっか……うん、そうですね！\nわかりました、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "这、这样啊……嗯，确实是这样！\n我明白了，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0274_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0274_2016_037nao", "source_sha256": "440072e69b1c6bd0605dcb0f7a4fb1be7d9d406047907c83c52a821f8f113a96", "ja": "自分をめいっぱい解放して、楽しんじゃいますね！\n全力全開の横山奈緒、見といてください！　えへへ。", "zh": "我要彻底释放自己，尽情享受啦！全力全开的横山奈绪，可要看好了哦！嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
